id: ops-62d1
title: Finish shell-accurate heredoc and unset handling in publish attestation
description: "PR 70 review found active heredoc openers inside comments and quotes, backslash-quoted delimiters, quoted unset, and same-line ordering gaps. Correct the real findings and prove each regression against reverted behavior."
