author: pi-agent
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T16:50:32.625Z",pi-agent,"Implemented all four real review findings: lexical heredoc opener detection ignores comments and quoted prose; backslash-quoted delimiters are recognized; quoted unset invokes the builtin; and scalar expansion/mutation is ordered per same-line shell segment. Added the five required bypass regressions. Revert proof against the PR head failed all four review regressions (backslash heredoc, quoted unset, phantom opener, same-line ordering) and restoration passed all four. Coverage instrumentation reports 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines; the full local command is separately blocked by the pre-existing installed-package timeout tracked as ops-gp0d."
  "2026-08-30T16:55:32.952Z",pi-agent,"Greptile follow-up fixed: assignments after conditional separators now clear prior evidence instead of preserving a stale provenance value. Exact true-and-empty and false-or-no-provenance regressions pass; reverting ambiguity clearing makes true && FLAG= pass incorrectly and the test fail 0 !== 1."
files[3]{path,scope}:
  scripts/shell-command-scan.ts,project
  scripts/verify-release-publish-attestation.ts,project
  test/verify-release-publish-attestation.test.ts,project
tests[1]{command,scope}:
